comment.narrative:
End target achieved at 19%. The implementing firm for Component 3.1 will be required to keep clear records of the number of firms supported under the component. This number will then be collected by the PIU.

After cancellation of SME support under component 3 and&nbsp;reallocation of resources to the COVID grant program, this indicator was maintained to capture the impact of technical support that might be provided to firms to adapt to the COVID context.&nbsp;

At implementation there was no such&nbsp;demand from beneficiaries.

&nbsp;

Achieved.
Satisfaction rating from post-workshops/meetings citizen engagement questionnaires (citizens are satisfiaed Yes/No). Feedback will be solicited on the satifsaction at meeting and/or workshop organized as part of project implementation, and the PIU will be responsible for collecting it, sorting it and compiling it.&nbsp;

&nbsp;
